{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Golemworks\u00a0</i></strong>is a fusion of the auto battler roguelike and factory sim genres. You must assemble an army of metal automatons which automatically fight and defend the factory from waves of encroaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.poster.avif?t=1757978947\" width=274 height=112 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.webm?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/1395ba7583afb59ce7057d9f4e1c25fd.mp4?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item cards</strong> are the production infrastructure. They can add EXP, elemental attributes, or otherwise alter a mold - the 'recipe' for the created automaton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.poster.avif?t=1757978947\" width=274 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.webm?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/7ceedc07c9aa6b82fa3ae4315be2498f.mp4?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anima cards</strong>\u00a0activate on a cooldown, and can add a variety of buffs and additional stats to active automatons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.poster.avif?t=1757978947\" width=302 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.webm?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/extras/0654c69d2fa619477b43ddc4da865f6b.mp4?t=1757978947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory will hinge on your ability to navigate random situations, and strike a balance between optimizing the army composition and amplifying the strength for each automaton. The fate of the ancient golemworks is in your hands...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ unlockable Anima and Item cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenges and adjustable difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918970?t=1757978947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918970?t=1757978947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/e80268c1d53676837447987a393a35afc5e743cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757978947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918970/e80268c1d53676837447987a393a35afc5e743cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757978947","categories":[{"desc